    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Changing the display Property"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You can use the display property to change an element to block or inline."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The default display value for the <li> tag is list-item, which controls how an element appears in a list. We will cover the display property in more depth in an upcoming chapter."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Idea Emoji",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<ul>\n2    <li><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n3    <li><a href=\"#\">About Us</a></li>\n4    <li><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n5</ul>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In this example, each list item contains a link."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Run the code to see the output."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Now, let's change the display property of <li> to inline, and adjust the styles for <a> to create a navigation menu:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<ul>\n2    <li><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n3    <li><a href=\"#\">About Us</a></li>\n4    <li><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n5</ul>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1li {\n2    display: inline;\n3    background: black;\n4}\n5\n6a {\n7    color: white;\n8    text-decoration: none;\n9}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Browser Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Changing the Display Property",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "From this simple example, you can see how useful the display property is for styling elements."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Idea Emoji",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You'll learn more about display as we dive into the box model in the next chapter."
    },
